cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TGBS, please cite this software."
title: "Task Group Bandwidth Server (TGBS)"
type: software
version: "1.3"

authors:
  - family-names: "Kooshmanian"
    given-names: "Merlin"

abstract: >
  TGBS is a Linux kernel scheduling extension providing temporal
  isolation between containers through hierarchical deadline-server
  scheduling, while allowing multiple native Linux scheduling
  policies within the same isolation domain.

repository-code: "https://github.com/mkooshmanian/TGBS"

license: "GPL-2.0-only"

keywords:
  - Linux kernel
  - scheduling
  - temporal isolation
  - hierarchical scheduling
  - containers
  - real-time systems